     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(66,66,66);font-family:Arial;font-size:14pt\">Hi everyone,</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\">I&#39;m working on a service for data analysis in the cloud called Domino.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\">We’re currently looking for Domino beta testers – we’re very much interested in Madison student feedback.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\">Domino makes it easy to run your R data analysis without thinking about server configuration, hosting, or other frustrations of configuring machines for computing. Domino saves a history of every run, with a snapshot of the inputs, code, and outputs so you can see how everything changed across versions.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\">If this sounds useful to you, register here for our beta:<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\"><a href=\"http://www.dominodatalab.com/infrastructure/?referrer=c4.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.dominodatalab.com/infrastructure/?referrer%3Dc4.8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244209289000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1oljOIFkWfFbiLvSXzvGwr\">http://www.dominodatalab.com/infrastructure/?referrer=c4.8</a><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\">Please let me know if you have any questions. Feel free to email directly at the below address, or I can respond here.<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\">Jake<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(66,66,66)\"><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ja...@dominodatalab.com</a></span></p></div>"
